			"version": 203,
			"versionNonce": 535073726,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1783686185629,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Concept: Start at index 0 and check every single box until you find the target or reach the end.\nRequirement: None. The array can be completely scrambled.\nTime Complexity: O(N) — In the worst case, you check every single item. O(1) In the best case,\nitem is at index 0.",
			"rawText": "Concept: Start at index 0 and check every single box until you find the target or reach the end.\nRequirement: None. The array can be completely scrambled.\nTime Complexity: O(N) — In the worst case, you check every single item. O(1) In the best case, item is at index 0.",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "tJuLRe9P",
			"originalText": "Concept: Start at index 0 and check every single box until you find the target or reach the end.\nRequirement: None. The array can be completely scrambled.\nTime Complexity: O(N) — In the worst case, you check every single item. O(1) In the best case, item is at index 0.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
