			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1783713408208,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Concept: Compares the target to the middle element; if they don't match, it permanently \n         eliminates the half of the array where the target physically cannot exist, then repeats.\nRequirements: The dataset must be strictly sorted beforehand. Requires O(1) auxiliary space for \n              iterative, and O(log N) space for the recursive call stack. \n              Works best with data structures that allow O(1) random access (like Arrays).\nTime Complexity: \n  - Best: O(1) (Target is exactly at the first middle checked) \n  - Average:O(log N) \n  - Worst: O(log N)",
			"rawText": "Concept: Compares the target to the middle element; if they don't match, it permanently \n         eliminates the half of the array where the target physically cannot exist, then repeats.\nRequirements: The dataset must be strictly sorted beforehand. Requires O(1) auxiliary space for \n              iterative, and O(log N) space for the recursive call stack. \n              Works best with data structures that allow O(1) random access (like Arrays).\nTime Complexity: \n  - Best: O(1) (Target is exactly at the first middle checked) \n  - Average:O(log N) \n  - Worst: O(log N)",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "1Cy-rtjpbnPfk5b1u47Fa",
			"originalText": "Concept: Compares the target to the middle element; if they don't match, it permanently \n         eliminates the half of the array where the target physically cannot exist, then repeats.\nRequirements: The dataset must be strictly sorted beforehand. Requires O(1) auxiliary space for \n              iterative, and O(log N) space for the recursive call stack. \n              Works best with data structures that allow O(1) random access (like Arrays).\nTime Complexity: \n  - Best: O(1) (Target is exactly at the first middle checked) \n  - Average:O(log N) \n  - Worst: O(log N)",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
		{
