		{
			"id": "NBy9r4nM",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -701.8159803579191,
			"y": 344.3507008970146,
			"width": 1033.998779296875,
			"height": 200,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "dashed",
			"roughness": 0,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b3P",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1671131700,
			"version": 1163,
			"versionNonce": 456116492,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1783717458498,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Concept: Pushes the heaviest/lightest element to the boundary of the unsorted section through\ncontinuous adjacent swaps, reducing the unsorted section by one element per pass.\nRequirements: Requires O(1) auxiliary space. The recursive approach requires O(N) space on the\ncall stack.\nTime Complexity: \n- Best: O(N) (If the array is already sorted and an isSorted flag is used). \n- Average: O(N^2)\n- Worst: O(N^2)",
			"rawText": "Concept: Pushes the heaviest/lightest element to the boundary of the unsorted section through continuous adjacent swaps, reducing the unsorted section by one element per pass.\nRequirements: Requires O(1) auxiliary space. The recursive approach requires O(N) space on the call stack.\nTime Complexity: \n- Best: O(N) (If the array is already sorted and an isSorted flag is used). \n- Average: O(N^2)\n- Worst: O(N^2)",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "pz1I-YVtWCNlMCKVWjaDw",
			"originalText": "Concept: Pushes the heaviest/lightest element to the boundary of the unsorted section through continuous adjacent swaps, reducing the unsorted section by one element per pass.\nRequirements: Requires O(1) auxiliary space. The recursive approach requires O(N) space on the call stack.\nTime Complexity: \n- Best: O(N) (If the array is already sorted and an isSorted flag is used). \n- Average: O(N^2)\n- Worst: O(N^2)",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
		{
			"id": "pFMp84dkrC1SJ8bs7hZ7M",
			"type": "rectangle",
			"x": -709.6009837567966,
