		},
		{
			"id": "GZQTCYb4",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 2661.8622632150814,
			"y": 272.88014534507533,
			"width": 1044.998779296875,
			"height": 225,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "dashed",
			"roughness": 0,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b5m",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 841747764,
			"version": 2175,
			"versionNonce": 833629324,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1783726046045,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Concept: An array of one element is inherently sorted. Merge sort breaks the dataset down to N\nsub-arrays of 1 element, then repeatedly merges adjacent sub-arrays into new, sorted sub-arrays\nuntil only 1 fully sorted array remains.\nRequirements: Requires O(N) auxiliary space (a temporary array) to hold data during the merging\nprocess.\nTime Complexity: \n- Best: O(N log N)\n- Average: O(N log N)\n- Worst: O(N log N)",
			"rawText": "Concept: An array of one element is inherently sorted. Merge sort breaks the dataset down to N sub-arrays of 1 element, then repeatedly merges adjacent sub-arrays into new, sorted sub-arrays until only 1 fully sorted array remains.\nRequirements: Requires O(N) auxiliary space (a temporary array) to hold data during the merging process.\nTime Complexity: \n- Best: O(N log N)\n- Average: O(N log N)\n- Worst: O(N log N)",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "_S31RJowtMZpEMRDELKlJ",
			"originalText": "Concept: An array of one element is inherently sorted. Merge sort breaks the dataset down to N sub-arrays of 1 element, then repeatedly merges adjacent sub-arrays into new, sorted sub-arrays until only 1 fully sorted array remains.\nRequirements: Requires O(N) auxiliary space (a temporary array) to hold data during the merging process.\nTime Complexity: \n- Best: O(N log N)\n- Average: O(N log N)\n- Worst: O(N log N)",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
		{
			"id": "-PEKxfdPxMssnTAXjdNVS",
			"type": "rectangle",
			"x": 2658.8831163244754,
			"y": 523.0695760361821,
			"width": 1077.6582948710984,
			"height": 160,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff",
